1. Use masking tape/sticky notes to label everything you can find in
your living space.
2. Think like a lodge, then ban it.
3. Try imagining selbri as whole concepts. For example, {klama} is the
concept of movement between two points. {dunda} is the idea of a
transfer of an object (with no mention of ownership or anything)
between two things.
4. Try imagining the places of selbri as individual concepts, and
think of how they relate to the whole.
5. Meditate on why {.i lo pluka ko li'i djedi} is one of the most
awesome and Lojbanic phrases ever, and what exactly it means.
6. Practice writing things as many ways as you can think of, from most
simple to most complex to most elegant.

Finally... HAVE FUN!
It'll set in eventually. =D

